DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260913
DTSTAMP:20260830T154643Z
UID:12d3a0db973c008639a07b39@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:100 Mile | 42K - Includes the advanced degree endurance race o
 f 100 miles\, with the addition of a 42 Kilometer race on Sunday. The race
 s navigate up\, down\, around\, and through the beautiful [Mogollon Rim](h
 ttp://www.paysonrimcountry.com/MountainRecreation/NaturalLandmarks/Mogollo
 nRim.aspx). The race covers roughly 101 miles\, climbing the Rim on six se
 parate locations spending a lot of miles along the Rim\, on top of the Rim
  and the challenging climbs up and down with climbs and descents at 30-45%
  grades at some points.\n\nEvent website: https://www.aravaiparunning.com/
 mogollon-monster-2/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com
 /events/mogollon-monster-100
